__I. As substantive verb. 
__1. Of persons and things, to be, exist: Actes 17:28, Jean 1:1, 8:58, 17:5, al; ὁ ὢν καὶ ὁ ἦν (for past ptcp.), Apocalypse 1:4, 8, 4:8, 11:17, 16:5 (see Swete, Ap., 5; M, Pr., 228); τὰ (μὴ) ὄντα, Romains 4:17, 1 Corinthiens 1:28. 
